INNOVATION MEDIA PMS - QUOTATION & INVOICE MODULE

COMPANY-SPECIFIC PRINT TEMPLATES
1) Innovation Media: unchanged; keeps the Innovation Media invoice layout from invoice_1785.pdf and uses the existing public/logo-color.png.
2) Sign Edge: unchanged; keeps the Sign Edge green/gold letter-style bill based on J M Global Overseas-1.pdf.
3) Aesthetic Edge: updated to follow the newly supplied Aesthetic Edge bill (bill for faridpur__Corrected Bill-1.pdf): Aesthetic Edge logo, gold/brown header bar, To / letter body, SI / Job Description / Dimension / Rate / Amount table, Total Amount, Advance, Payment, amount in words, Md Ataur Rahman Robin / COO signature, and grey footer. Uses Aesthetic Edge's supplied phone number and shared address. Email is omitted as requested.

INSTALLATION
1. Back up your current source files and database.
2. Run billing_module_setup.sql in Supabase SQL Editor.
3. Replace src/main.jsx with main.jsx.
4. Replace src/style.css with style.css.
5. Copy the two PNG files from public/ into your project's public/ folder.
6. Keep your existing public/logo-color.png for Innovation Media.
7. Commit, push, merge and deploy.

DOCUMENT NUMBERING
Quotation: QUO-IM-YYYY-0001 / QUO-SE-YYYY-0001 / QUO-AE-YYYY-0001
Invoice:   INV-IM-YYYY-0001 / INV-SE-YYYY-0001 / INV-AE-YYYY-0001

PDF OUTPUT
The Print / PDF action opens the browser print dialog. Choose Save as PDF.
